# Access card for aboutcorwin.com. Plain words, one "key: value" per line. See deploy/ACCESS-CARD.md.
# No key paths, no passwords, no key text: only the NAME the key register answers to.
card: aboutcorwin.com on DreamHost shared hosting
updated: 2026-11-01
host: iad1-shared-b8-03.dreamhost.com
user: dh_f4vxkv
key-register: aboutcorwinhost
web-root: ~/aboutcorwin.com
staging-root: ~/aboutcorwin.com-releases
tools: git, python3, perl, rsync, make, emacs, node, php
may: read the account's sites and their history
may: write into a new dated folder under the staging root
may: replace files in the web root, but only after a backup copy of it exists
may-not: delete old site copies or releases
may-not: touch mail, databases or the crontab
may-not: touch any other user
may-not: touch .dh-diag (a root-owned link DreamHost keeps in the web root)
note: nothing is installed on the host for the deploy; the three scripts travel inside each release.
